   "locked": false,
   "text": "Each refusal stops at the first layer that can say no, and the layers behind it never see\nthe request. The two allowed beats pass them all.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Each refusal stops at the first layer that can say no, and the layers behind it never see\nthe request. The two allowed beats pass them all.",
